# Diagrams

A flowchart:

``` mermaid
graph LR
  A[Start] --> B{Choice}
  B -->|yes| C[One]
  B -->|no| D[Other]
```

A sequence diagram:

``` mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  Alice->>Bob: Hello
  Bob-->>Alice: Hi
```

A diagram with a syntax error:

``` mermaid
graph LR
  A -->
```

A diagram whose label contains HTML, whose onerror handler must not run:

``` mermaid
graph LR
  A["<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>"] --> B
```
